---
---

<section class="py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-bg-base via-brand-primary/5 to-bg-base -z-10"></div>
  
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
      Deja de adivinar. <br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-primary to-brand-secondary">Empieza a valorar.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xl text-text-secondary mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Únete a los profesionales que ya usan Inteligencia Artificial para tomar el control de sus carreras y maximizar sus ingresos.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
      <a 
        href="https://vaalora.vercel.app" 
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-md bg-brand-primary hover:bg-brand-primary-hover text-bg-base text-lg font-bold transition-all shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(3,218,197,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(3,218,197,0.6)] hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        Entrar a la Web App
      </a>
      <a 
        href="/downloads/valora.apk" 
        download
        class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-md glass-card hover:bg-white/10 text-white text-lg font-semibold transition-all hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        Descargar el APK
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
